  "description": "Versioned links to a product's authored static assets, the files listed in the repo's .webority/infra/deployables.json and stored on Cloudflare R2, from any .NET host: IAuthoredAssets.Url(key) returns the authored origin, the key and ?v= with the first 12 hex of the file's sha256. A host without pages (Azure Functions, a worker) registers it with AddWeborityStaticAssets; a web head gets it from Webority.Delivery.AspNetCore. The WeborityStaticAssets MSBuild property copies the repo's deployables.json into the build and publish output of any project type.",
